   "type": "MSQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • COMPUTER SCIENCE • +2 / -0",
   "html": "<p>\n\tConsider set <em>S</em> = {10, 20, 30, 41, 52, 59, 60}. Which of the following is/are the correct partition of the given set?</p>",
   "options": [
